              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Agrianians may replace javelins with sling (free). Every second unit of mercenaries may replace javelins and buckler with composite bow (+1) or sling (free). All are Skirmishers. There may be one unit of Agrianians for every two units of other skirmishers. Agrianians and Mercenaries can be upgraded to veterans with the Veteran rule for (+1) points.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
